## Context

Choisir et justifier le premier runtime accessible. Vérifier en session réelle les instructions communes, lecture à la demande, capture factuelle committée et résultat de rêve relisible. Le choix ne privilégie pas durablement ce runtime.

Baseline : [v8](../docs/2026-09-10-dragon-memory-design.md) et
[plan de livraison](../docs/2026-09-11-memory-implementation-plan.md).
Les anciennes obligations v7 sont remplacées, pas déclarées implémentées.

## Actions et vérification

Exécuter ce périmètre par branche/PR, préserver les sources et enregistrer les
preuves pertinentes. Vérifier les cas d’échec, les liens et les commits ;
exécuter les checks applicables au diff. Aucun package hoard requis.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Version, conditions de confiance, mécanisme AGENTS.md/compatibilité et preuves enregistrés.
- [ ] Index et thème pertinent lus avant action ; journal récent trouvable sans rêve.
- [ ] Positif/négatif/quasi-accident capturés ; routine sans entrée artificielle ; aucune promotion à roar.
- [ ] Note native contradictoire testée et limite honnêtement décrite.
- [ ] Clone à chemin arbitraire fonctionne ; un mot témoin seul ne vaut pas preuve d’adhérence.

## Raid annotation (2026-10-02, imagine pass)

- PREMISE: the pilot setup merges already demonstrated reading-before-action (#1109), a readable dream result (#1119), and capture pinning (#1117). The first runtime is de facto chosen: Vibe CLI, per the pilot declaration — record that justification, do not re-run runtime selection. This ticket is now a smoke of the UNEXERCISED legs.
- DELIVERABLES (one evidence-recording session in this runtime, recording blob revisions as the first dream report models): (a) read-before-action evidence against the live memory surface; (b) one deliberate factual capture through scripts/memory-capture.sh as roar step 6 prescribes — a PUBLIC entry only: the private/.age leg is DEFERRED by author decision (blind-spot F2, recorded in the ticket log) because no legitimate uncleared material exists — record the deferral and the limit honestly in the evidence; (c) plant a contradictory native note in a disposable location, exercise the honest-limit reporting the convention demands, report it; (d) clone this repository to an arbitrary path and verify the memory surface resolves there per the 0999 portable contract; (e) the miswired-delivery negative control (deliver the index broken/absent in a disposable setup and show the honest failure, not a silent pass).
- BLIND-SPOT F1 (record in the ticket log before any capture): read tickets/1014 (key-derivation colon collision, reviewer-attribution programme) and record the ordering decision — this repo's origin URL carries no port so the real key is unaffected; proceed with the collision explicitly noted in the evidence.
- ANTIPATTERNS: no adapter code (v8 needs none — call the work a runtime smoke); use scripts/memory-capture.sh as-is, never wrap it; no runtime-compat matrix or templates — factual journal entries and one evidence doc only; no artificial journal entries (the deliberate captures above are the smoke's own evidence entries, clearly marked as such).
